The '''Orange Sapling''' is a [[Fruit Trees|Fruit Tree]] sapling that takes 28 days to grow into an [[Orange Tree]], after which it will produce one fruit each day during the [[Summer]]. Like all Fruit Trees, it will produce fruit all year round if planted in the [[Greenhouse]].

It can be purchased from [[Pierre's General Store]] and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]].  It may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern, or as the second prize from the Prize Machine in the [[Mayor's Manor]] (50% chance). One Orange Sapling may be received from opening a [[Mystery Box]] or [[Golden Mystery Box]].

